## 9. How to inspect the project

1. Watch [GrabMate_Demo.mp4](prototype/GrabMate_Demo.mp4) and review [the presentation](docs/GrabMate_Presentation.pdf).
2. Read [the development notebook](analysis/GrabMate_EDA_Modeling_Prototype.ipynb) for source and saved figures. The first two cells require the **missing original dataset**.
3. Check [ML results](results/Model_Evaluation.md) and the [model methodology](models/README.md).
4. Review [the WBS and project controls](docs/project-management/README.md).

**Running from source:** The original notebook used a Windows-specific local dataset path, changed to `data/hcm_multimodal_dataset_v3.xlsx` in this archived copy. To retrain, obtain the original dataset, install packages in `requirements.txt`, run notebook cells in order, and use `model.pkl` created by its training stage. Network access is required for Nominatim lookups. The demo is console/notebook-driven; no standalone deployed web app is claimed.

